{"unit_id":"tag:06IU:proof","translation":"若<MATH_0001>是万有的（versal），则 (1) 由引理<REF_0001>成立，(2) 由注记<REF_0002>成立。假设 (1) 和 (2) 成立。由注记<REF_0003>，须证明给定<MATH_0002>中的图（diagram），如 (2) 所述，存在<MATH_0003>使得\n<MATH_0004>\n交换（commutes）。设<MATH_0005>是 (2) 保证的映射（map）。记<MATH_0006>，并选取分解（factorization）<MATH_0007>，它位于<MATH_0008>之上，是给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>的分解。由 (S1)，得到交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATHSEG_0001>位于其上<MATHSEG_0002>\n令<MATH_0010>。设<MATH_0011>是环映射（ring map）<MATH_0012>，参见<SPACE_0001>引理<REF_0004>。由 (1)，存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，它位于环映射（ring map）<MATH_0014>之上。选取阿廷（Artinian）商（quotient）<MATH_0015>，使得<MATH_0016>和<MATH_0017>都通过<MATH_0018>分解，即给出<MATH_0019>和<MATH_0020>。选取推前（pushforward）<MATH_0021>，分解（factorization）<MATH_0022>，它位于<MATH_0023>之上，是<MATH_0024>的分解，以及分解（factorization）<MATH_0025>，它位于<MATH_0026>之上，是<MATH_0027>的分解。再次应用 (S1)，得到\n<MATHSEG_0003>位于其上<MATHSEG_0004>\n注意映射（map）<MATH_0028>，即引理<REF_0005>中的映射（用<MATH_0029>定义），是<MATH_0030>与上面的映射（map）<MATH_0031>的复合（composition）。由构造，存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0032>！因此引理<REF_0006>适用（于上述图（diagrams）的外围矩形），给出态射（morphism）<MATH_0033>，而预复合以<MATH_0034>给出所需态射（morphism）<MATH_0035>。\n","allowed_english":["S"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"so