{"unit_id":"tag:06T0:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们做一些工作，尝试理解万有的（versal）形式对象（formal objects）的（非）唯一性。结果是，若预形变范畴（predeformation category）具有万有的（versal）形式对象（formal object），则它具有极小的（minimal）万有的（versal）形式对象（formal object），且任意两个这样的对象同构（isomorphic）。此外，所有万有的（versal）形式对象（formal objects）在将底环（base ring）替换为幂级数扩张（power series extension）的意义下，都“或多或少”相同。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>是余纤维范畴（category）于群胚（groupoids），在<MATH_0002>上。对于每个对象（object）<MATH_0003>，它属于<MATH_0004>且位于<MATH_0005>之上，考虑范畴（category）<MATH_0006>，其对象（objects）为\n<MATHSEG_0001>位于<MATHSEG_0002>之上\n而态射（morphisms）为<MATH_0007>上的态射（morphisms）。对于每个<MATH_0008>，它在<MATH_0009>中，且位于<MATH_0010>之上，后者在<MATH_0011>中，存在函子（functor）<MATH_0012>，定义如下：给定<MATH_0013>位于<MATH_0014>之上，令<MATH_0015>，并设<MATH_0016>位于<MATH_0017>上，是<MATH_0018>的推前（pushforward）。由余纤维范畴（category）于群胚（groupoids）的公理，得到唯一态射（morphism）<MATH_0019>，它位于<MATH_0020>之上，使得\n<MATH_0021>\n交换（commutes）。则<MATH_0022>是<MATH_0023>的对象（object）。我们称对象（object）<MATH_0024>，它属于<MATH_0025>，为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>极小的（minimal）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0026>，它在<MATH_0027>中，都是同构（isomorphism），即<MATH_0028>和<MATH_0029>定义在<MATH_0030>的同一子环（subring）上。由于<MATH_0031>具有有限长度（finite length），作为<MATH_0032>-模（module），可见极小的（minimal）对象（objects）总是存在。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"formal objects","target_term":"形式对象"},{"source_term":"predeformation category","target_term":"预形变范畴"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"formal object","target_term":"形式对象"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"formal object","target_term":"形式对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term":"formal objects","target_term":"形式对象"},{"source_term":"base ring","target_term":"底环"},{"source_term":"power series extension","target_term":"幂级数扩张"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"subring","target_term":"子环"},{"source_term":"finite length","target_term":"有限长度"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"formal objects","target_term":"形式对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"predeformation category","target_term":"预形变范畴","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"formal object","target_term":"形式对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"base ring","target_term":"底环","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"power series extension","target_term":"幂级数扩张","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"词表未批准"},{"source_term":"