{"unit_id":"tag:06T3:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>，存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>。由引理<REF_0002>，相应映射（map）<MATH_0002>诱导满射（surjection）<MATH_0003>。由代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0003>，这是同构（isomorphism）。因此<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的理想（ideal），使得<MATH_0006>。设<MATH_0007>是元素（elements），它们构成<MATH_0008>的一组基（basis）。考虑映射（map）<MATH_0009>，它将<MATH_0010>映至<MATH_0011>。对于每个<MATH_0012>，得到满射（surjection），在阿廷（Artinian）<MATH_0013>-代数（algebras）之间，记为<MATH_0014>。用<MATH_0015>，分别用<SPACE_0001><MATH_0016>，表示<MATH_0017>沿<MATH_0018>，分别沿<SPACE_0002><MATH_0019>的推前（pushforward）。注意<MATH_0020>也是<MATH_0021>沿<MATH_0022>的推前（pushforward），因为<MATH_0023>是<MATH_0024>沿<MATH_0025>的推前（pushforward）。因此有实线图（diagram）\n<MATHSEG_0001>位于其上<MATHSEG_0002>\n因为<MATH_0026>是万有的（versal），利用注记<REF_0004>，得到可置于这些图（diagrams）中的虚线箭头。特别地，映射（maps）<MATH_0027>具有截面（sections）<MATH_0028>。由引理<REF_0005>可知<MATH_0029>是同构（isomorphism）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n由于<MATH_0030>是<MATH_0031>沿<MATH_0032>的推前（pushforward），由注记<REF_0006>得到交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0033>\n由于<MATH_0034>具有左逆（inverse）（即<MATH_0035>），可见<MATH_0036>是本质满射的（essentially surjective）。因此由引理<REF_0007>可见<MATH_0037>是光滑的（smooth），即<MATH_0038>是万有的（versal）形式对象（formal object）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjection","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推前"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"versal","target_term":"万有的"},{"source_term"